 "description": "<p>A kimono set with a vintage print: robe, waist seal, and underwear, all polyester, all as pictured. The waist seal matters more than it looks - it is what turns a robe into a silhouette.</p>\n<p>Cut generously, with a 70-120 cm bust range and 60-90 cm waist range covering 40-70 kg, one of the wider single-size ranges in this category. The chiffon-weight polyester drapes rather than flares, which suits the kimono line.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: kimono, waist seal, underwear</li>\n<li>Style: Japanese vintage print</li>\n<li>Color: as pictured</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, bust 70-120 cm, waist 60-90 cm, 40-70 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Wear it open over the included underwear for the full effect, or closed with the seal for a tea-ceremony mood. Either way it travels well.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Vintage print chiffon kimono set with waist seal and underwear, one size for 40-70 kg with wide bust range.</p>\n",
